            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Meet George & Grace ",
            "content": "<p>At George & Grace London, everything starts with a shared love for fashion and family. From a young age, George and Grace were both drawn to style, creativity, and the beauty of timeless design.</p><p>After studying Fashion Design and Business at leading London institutions, they built their careers within the industry and found each other along the way. Together, they turned a shared dream into something truly their own.</p><p>More than 10 years ago, they founded George & Grace London and today, it has grown into a brand trusted by countless happy customers. Along the way, they also built a family, and it is their greatest hope that one day their children will carry this story forward.</p><p>Their mission remains what it has always been: to bring you beautiful, high-quality pieces and make every shopping experience feel special.</p><p>Because at George & Grace London, you're not just a customer, you're part of the family.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "background": "#ffffff",
            "background_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#000000",
            "text_gradient": "",
